            ],
            "citations": [
              {
                "identifier": "cite_note-1",
                "text": "[1]"
              },
              {
                "identifier": "cite_note-2",
                "text": "[2]"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "value": "He entered the Friedrich Flick Industry Holding Company in 1953, but had a fall-out with his father in about 1960. Otto-Ernst took his father to court to secure his inheritance, and after a prolonged struggle, received a payment for settlement. He retired in Düsseldorf and died in 1974. His surviving brother, Friedrich Karl Flick gained full control of the business after he paid out the children of Otto-Ernst.",
            "links": [
              {
                "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Friedrich_Karl_Flick",
                "text": "Friedrich Karl Flick"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "value": "He died on January 4, 1974, at age 57 in Meerbusch DE.",
            "links": [
              {
                "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Otto-Ernst_Flick#cite_note-:0-1"
              }
